Ontario","kind":"Official guidance, not legislation","jurisdiction":"Ontario; actual work and exemptions require assessment","published":null,"effective":null,"retrieved":"2026-10-07","verification":"Official public page read. No publication/revision date shown; retrieval date is not an effective date."},{"id":"309a","title":"Electrician – Construction and Maintenance","url":"https://www.skilledtradesontario.ca/trade-information/electrician-construction-and-maintenance/","section":"309A scope and compulsory classification","authority":"Skilled Trades Ontario","kind":"Official guidance, not legislation","jurisdiction":"Ontario; actual work and exemptions require assessment","published":null,"effective":null,"retrieved":"2026-10-07","verification":"Official public page read. No publication/revision date shown; retrieval date is not an effective date."},{"id":"standards","title":"Employer procedures and licensed electrical safety standards","authority":"Employer / applicable standards publisher","url":"https://www.ontario.ca/laws/regulation/910213","section":"Employer procedure reference; O. Reg. 213/91 s.190 where applicable","kind":"Company procedure / supporting technical standard, not automatically legislation","jurisdiction":"Specific employer, work and adopted edition","published":null,"effective":null,"retrieved":"2026-10-07","verification":"Employer procedures and licensed CSA Z462/CEC full text were not supplied. No standard clauses reproduced, edition inferred, PPE prescribed or live-work procedure generated."},{"id":"director-order","authority":"Electrical Safety Authority","title":"Director order OESC-01-2024, revision 0","url":"https://esasafe.com/assets/files/esasafe/pdf/About_ESA/Directors-Order-OESC-29thEdition-Final.pdf","section":"Page 1; amendment of Subrule 2-010(1)(e)","kind":"Director order under Electricity Act s.113(5)(a)","jurisdiction":"Ontario; specified Section 64 installations and bidirectional EV supply equipment, not every residential circuit","published":"2026-06-22","effective":"2026-07-06","retrieved":"2026-10-07","verification":"Full official one-page PDF verified. Specific 12 kW output threshold change; no automated plan-review applicability decision implemented."},{"id":"ontario-amendments","authority":"Electrical Safety Authority","title":"Ontario Amendments to Canadian Electrical Code Part I","url":"https://esasafe.com/assets/files/esasafe/pdf/amendments/2024/2024-Ontario-Amendments-Final.pdf","section":"Printed pp.3?4: scope and notification Rules 2-000 through 2-004; cover and opening adoption text","kind":"Published Ontario amendments; adopted code material, not ministry guidance","jurisdiction":"Ontario installations subject to adoption regulation and subsequent orders","published":"2024-11-13","effective":null,"retrieved":"2026-10-07","verification":"Official PDF cover says November 2024, inner date November 13, 2024. Opening adoption line refers to C22.1-21 while current O.Reg.164/99 adopts C22.1:24 and June 12, 2024 amendments. Record this source inconsistency for ESA/qualified review; do not silently reconcile it or use this standalone PDF as the complete current Code."}],"prompts":[{"id":"electrical-job-scope","version":1,"title":"Confirm this job’s setting","wording":"Record the residential work type, scope, circuit identifiers and any unresolved workplace or code applicability question.","sourceIds":["oesc-law","ohsa","construction","edition","director-order"],"applicability":"Before selecting requirements for this job.","rationale":"Separate installation rules from workplace rules.","limits":"No industrial, utility or live-work assessment.","task":"residential-electrical-recording","reviewStatus":"draft","reviewQuestions":"Confirm wording, current source mapping, setting/exemption boundaries and omissions within your qualification scope. No industrial, utility or live-work assessment."},{"id":"electrical-job-credentials","version":1,"title":"Record people and credential evidence","wording":"Record the contractor business and LEC reference, designated master electrician and each relevant individual qualification reference. Record any actual external check separately.","sourceIds":["licensing","lec","sto","309a"],"applicability":"Contractor jobs and participating personnel; consider specific statutory exemptions.","rationale":"An app administrator is not a professional credential.","limits":"No live registry verification; a user report of a check is not independent TradeSafe validation.","task":"residential-electrical-recording","reviewStatus":"draft","reviewQuestions":"Confirm wording, current source mapping, setting/exemption boundaries and omissions within your qualification scope. No live registry verification; a user report of a check is not independent TradeSafe validation."},{"id":"electrical-job-notification","version":1,"title":"Keep ESA status separate","wording":"Record a notification reference or an unresolved applicability question with its proposed basis and source. Record inspection requests, outcomes and retained evidence separately.","sourceIds":["notification","oesc-law","ontario-amendments"],"applicability":"Before relying on notification or acceptance status.","rationale":"Internal completion does not issue an ESA certificate.","limits":"No automated exemption, inspection or acceptance decision.","task":"residential-electrical-recording","reviewStatus":"draft","reviewQuestions":"Confirm wording, current source mapping, setting/exemption boundaries and omissions within your qualification scope. No automated exemption, inspection or acceptance decision."},{"id":"electrical-job-hazards","version":1,"title":"Record the qualified assessment and procedures","wording":"Reference the responsible personnel’s hazard assessment, applicable employer procedure version and verification record. Put today’s hazards and controls in the daily brief; record new concerns at any time.","sourceIds":["construction","ohsa","standards"],"applicability":"Only after establishing the actual workplace and task context.","rationale":"Keep assessment, implemented controls and review distinct.","limits":"No live-work instructions, PPE selection, voltage inference or energization authorization.","task":"residential-electrical-recording","reviewStatus":"draft","reviewQuestions":"Confirm wording, current source mapping, setting/exemption boundaries and omissions within your qualification scope. No live-work instructions, PPE selection, voltage inference or energization authorization."},{"id":"electrical-job-handover","version":1,"title":"Show what remains unresolved","wording":"Identify missing documentation, link deficiencies to Actions, and retain the original finding and later correction separately.","sourceIds":["notification","licensing"],"applicability":"Handover and subsequent follow-up.","rationale":"Keeps documentation, internal review, ESA status and attached evidence independent.","limits":"A closed action or acknowledgement is not legal approval.","task":"residential-electrical-recording","reviewStatus":"draft","reviewQuestions":"Confirm wording, current source mapping, setting/exemption boundaries and omissions within your qualification scope. A closed action or acknowledgement is not legal approval."}]}$content$::jsonb,'TradeSafe draft-content engineering');

CREATE FUNCTION public.ts_electrical_command(command text,p jsonb) RETURNS jsonb LANGUAGE plpgsql SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path=pg_catalog,public AS $$
DECLARE actor uuid:=auth.uid(); c uuid; target uuid; req uuid; s public.ts_sites; j public.ts_electrical_jobs;
 prior public.ts_site_requests; d jsonb; result jsonb; fingerprint text; f jsonb; fields jsonb:= $fields$[{"key":"workKind","label":"Type of electrical work","group":"Scope","options":["unknown","new installation","alteration","repair","service"]},{"key":"setting","label":"Confirmed work setting","group":"Scope","options":["unknown","Ontario residential construction project","Ontario residential setting requiring applicability review","other — use general documentation"]},{"key":"scope","label":"Job scope and location within the site","group":"Scope","max":2000},{"key":"equipment","label":"Equipment and circuit identifiers","group":"Scope","max":1000},{"key":"applicability","label":"Workplace applicability questions or disputed basis","group":"Scope","max":2000},{"key":"business","label":"Contractor business","group":"People and credentials","max":200},{"key":"lec","label":"LEC licence reference (user entered)","group":"People and credentials","max":200},{"key":"personnel","label":"Responsible personnel and designated master electrician","group":"People and credentials","max":2000},{"key":"qualifications","label":"Individual qualification references and evidence location","group":"People and credentials","max":3000},{"key":"notification","label":"ESA notification applicability","group":"ESA record","options":["unknown — review needed","notification reference recorded","exemption basis proposed — review needed","disputed — review needed"]},{"key":"notificationRef","label":"ESA notification reference","group":"ESA record","max":200},{"key":"notificationBasis","label":"Applicability question or proposed exemption basis and source","group":"ESA record","max":2000},{"key":"codeEdition","label":"Applicable OESC edition and basis (recorded by user)","group":"ESA record","max":500},{"key":"inspection","label":"ESA inspection or review status (reported)","group":"ESA record","options":["not recorded","request recorded","awaiting outcome","defects recorded","acceptance reported","applicability unresolved"]},{"key":"inspectionRecord","label":"Request date, outcome, defect notice and ESA reference","group":"ESA record","max":3000},{"key":"assessment","label":"Qualified personnel assessment reference and unresolved hazards","group":"Safety records","max":3000},{"key":"procedure","label":"Employer isolation / lockout procedure and version reference","group":"Safety records","max":2000},{"key":"verification","label":"Verification record, performer and time (user entered)","group":"Safety records","max":2000},{"key":"documentation","label":"TradeSafe documentation status (reported)","group":"Handover","options":["in progress","documentation complete reported"]},{"key":"handover","label":"Outstanding documentation and handover notes","group":"Handover","max":2000}]$fields$::jsonb;
 evidence jsonb:='[]'::jsonb; photo public.ts_evidence; key text; kind text; snap jsonb; check_record jsonb; review_record jsonb;
BEGIN
 IF actor IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_unauthorized'; END IF;
 IF p IS NULL OR jsonb_typeof(p)<>'object' OR octet_length(p::text)>30000 OR command IS NULL OR command NOT IN ('save','credential_check','review') THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
 c:=(p->>'companyId')::uuid;target:=(p->>'siteId')::uuid;req:=(p->>'requestId')::uuid;
 IF c IS NULL OR target IS NULL OR req IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
 PERFORM 1 FROM public.ts_companies WHERE id=c FOR UPDATE;
 IF coalesce(public.ts_role(c),'') NOT IN ('owner','supervisor') THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_denied'; END IF;
 SELECT * INTO s FROM public.ts_sites WHERE id=target AND company_id=c FOR UPDATE;
 IF NOT FOUND THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_not_found'; END IF;
 fingerprint:=encode(sha256(convert_to('electrical:'||command||p::text,'UTF8')),'hex');
 SELECT * INTO prior FROM public.ts_site_requests WHERE company_id=c AND request_id=req;
 IF FOUND THEN
  IF prior.actor_id<>actor OR prior.digest<>fingerprint THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_conflict'; END IF;
  RETURN prior.result;
 END IF;
 IF s.archived THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_site_archived'; END IF;
 SELECT * INTO j FROM public.ts_electrical_jobs WHERE site_id=target FOR UPDATE;
 IF (p->>'revision')::integer IS DISTINCT FROM coalesce(j.revision,0) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_conflict'; END IF;
 IF coalesce(j.revision,0)>=1000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_electrical_limit'; END IF;
 d:=j.document;check_record:=j.credential_check;review_record:=j.internal_review;
 IF command='save' THEN
  d:=p->'document';
  IF d IS NULL OR jsonb_typeof(d)<>'object' OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_object_keys(d) k WHERE k NOT IN (SELECT x->>'key' FROM jsonb_array_elements(fields) x) AND k NOT IN ('certificatePhoto','defectPhoto')) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
  FOR f IN SELECT * FROM jsonb_array_elements(fields) LOOP
   key:=f->>'key';
   IF jsonb_typeof(d->key) IS DISTINCT FROM 'string' OR length(d->>key)>coalesce((f->>'max')::integer,200) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
   IF f ? 'options' AND NOT f->'options' ? (d->>key) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
  END LOOP;
  IF d->>'notification'='notification reference recorded' AND length(trim(d->>'notificationRef'))=0 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
  IF d->>'notification' IN ('exemption basis proposed — review needed','disputed — review needed') AND length(trim(d->>'notificationBasis'))=0 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
  review_record:=NULL;
  IF j.document IS NULL OR (j.document->>'business',j.document->>'lec',j.document->>'personnel',j.document->>'qualifications') IS DISTINCT FROM (d->>'business',d->>'lec',d->>'personnel',d->>'qualifications') THEN check_record:=NULL; END IF;
 ELSE
  IF j.site_id IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_not_found'; END IF;
  IF jsonb_typeof(p->'note') IS DISTINCT FROM 'string' OR length(trim(p->>'note')) NOT BETWEEN 1 AND 2000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
  IF command='credential_check' THEN
   IF jsonb_typeof(p->'source') IS DISTINCT FROM 'string' OR length(trim(p->>'source')) NOT BETWEEN 1 AND 500 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
   check_record:=jsonb_build_object('reportedBy',actor,'recordedAt',now(),'source',p->>'source','note',p->>'note','basisRevision',j.revision,'label','External check reported by user; not live TradeSafe verification');
   review_record:=NULL;
  ELSE review_record:=jsonb_build_object('actor',actor,'recordedAt',now(),'note',p->>'note','basisRevision',j.revision,'label','Internal documentation review only; not professional content approval or ESA acceptance'); END IF;
 END IF;
 FOR key,kind IN SELECT * FROM (VALUES('certificatePhoto','Certificate of Acceptance evidence (user identified)'),('defectPhoto','Defect notice evidence (user identified)')) x(k,v) LOOP
  IF jsonb_typeof(d->key) IS DISTINCT FROM 'string' THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_invalid'; END IF;
  IF d->>key<>'' THEN
   SELECT e.* INTO photo FROM public.ts_evidence e JOIN public.ts_reports r ON r.id=e.report_id JOIN public.ts_site_links l ON l.report_id=r.id
   WHERE e.id=(d->>key)::uuid AND e.company_id=c AND r.company_id=c AND l.company_id=c AND l.site_id=target AND r.lifecycle='finalized' AND r.template_id LIKE 'electrical:%' AND e.state='ready';
   IF NOT FOUND THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'TS_denied'; END IF;
   evidence:=evidence||jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('kind',kind,'id',photo.id,'reportId',photo.report_id,'caption',photo.caption,'sha256',photo.sha256));
  END IF;
 END LOOP;
 INSERT INTO public.ts_electrical_jobs(site_id,company_id,document,revision,updated_by,credential_check,internal_review)
 VALUES(target,c,d,1,actor,check_record,review_record)
 ON CONFLICT(site_id) DO UPDATE SET document=d,revision=ts_electrical_jobs.revision+1,updated_by=actor,updated_at=now(),credential_check=check_record,internal_review=review_record RETURNING * INTO j;
 snap:=jsonb_build_object('document',d,'site',s.document,'company',(SELECT name FROM public.ts_companies WHERE id=c),'practice',(SELECT practice FROM public.ts_companies WHERE id=c),'actorName',(SELECT display_name FROM public.ts_members WHERE company_id=c AND user_id=actor),'credentialCheck',check_record,'internalReview',review_record,'evidence',evidence,'content',(SELECT to_jsonb(x) FROM public.ts_brief_content_catalog x WHERE version='on-residential-electrical-2026-10-07-v1'));
 INSERT INTO public.ts_electrical_job_versions(site_id,company_id,revision,snapshot,recorded_by) VALUES(target,c,j.revision,snap,actor);
 result:=to_jsonb(j);
 INSERT INTO public.ts_site_requests(company_id,request_id,actor_id,digest,result) VALUES(c,req,actor,fingerprint,result);
 RETURN result;
END $$;
REVOKE ALL ON FUNCTION public.ts_electrical_command(text,jsonb) FROM PUBLIC,anon;
GRANT EXECUTE ON FUNCTION public.ts_electrical_command(text,jsonb) TO authenticated;
COMMIT;
